   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 5,000eb (Luxury)<br>\n<strong>Covers:</strong> Head<br>\n<strong>SP:</strong> 12<br>\n<strong>Armor Penalty:</strong> none</p>\n<p>Built in: Smart Glasses upgraded to +1 option slot, holding Anti-Dazzle and Low Light/Infrared/UV. With Melee Weapon 7+ or Combat Awareness Rank 2+, +1 to Melee Weapon attacks (+2 on Aimed Shots). The +1 is automated while equipped; add the extra point on Aimed Shots by hand, and disable the effect if you don't qualify. Repairs 1 lost SP at the end of each day it loses none.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Armor Catalog).</em></p>"
